<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>اختبار الميول المهنية | ثانوية الجنان</title>
<style>
:root{
--bg:#f5faf7;
--panel:rgba(255,255,255,.88);
--white:#fff;
--text:#12281f;
--muted:#68786f;
--line:#e3eee7;
--green-950:#082317;
--green-900:#0d402a;
--green-850:#105838;
--green-800:#157347;
--green-700:#1b8d58;
--green-650:#20a864;
--green-600:#26bf71;
--green-500:#3dd384;
--green-100:#ebfbf1;
--amber:#b97a18;
--blue:#2b6cb0;
--red:#c24a4a;
--shadow-xl:0 28px 70px rgba(10,45,26,.12);
--shadow-lg:0 16px 32px rgba(10,45,26,.08);
--shadow-md:0 8px 18px rgba(10,45,26,.06);
--r-2xl:30px;
--r-xl:24px;
--r-lg:18px;
--r-md:14px;
--tr:.25s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
}

*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
margin:0;
font-family:Inter,"Segoe UI",Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;
color:var(--text);
background:
radial-gradient(circle at 10% 8%, rgba(38,191,113,.12), transparent 24%),
radial-gradient(circle at 92% 0%, rgba(61,211,132,.10), transparent 18%),
linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fcf9 0%, #eef7f1 100%);
min-height:100vh;
-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
}

.wrap{
width:min(1220px, calc(100% - 24px));
margin:20px auto 56px;
}

.card{
background:var(--panel);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
border-radius:var(--r-2xl);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-xl);
backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
}

.hero{
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
padding:36px;
color:#fff;
background:
linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(8,35,23,.97), rgba(16,88,56,.94) 52%, rgba(32,168,100,.92)),
linear-gradient(180deg,#0d402a,#1b8d58);
isolation:isolate;
}

.hero::before,.hero::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
border-radius:999px;
z-index:-1;
filter:blur(6px);
}
.hero::before{
width:360px;height:360px;top:-130px;inset-inline-start:-40px;
background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,255,255,.14),transparent 65%);
}
.hero::after{
width:320px;height:320px;bottom:-120px;inset-inline-end:-60px;
background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(61,211,132,.28),transparent 68%);
}

.hero-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1.35fr .85fr;
gap:28px;
align-items:center;
}

.eyebrow{
display:inline-flex;
gap:10px;
align-items:center;
padding:9px 14px;
border-radius:999px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
font-size:13px;
font-weight:700;
margin-bottom:18px;
}

h1,h2,h3,h4,p{margin:0}
.hero h1{
font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,50px);
line-height:1.1;
letter-spacing:-.02em;
margin-bottom:14px;
max-width:12ch;
}
.hero p{
font-size:15px;
line-height:1.95;
color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);
max-width:760px;
}

.hero-pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}
.pill{
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
color:#fff;
border-radius:999px;
padding:8px 12px;
font-size:12px;
font-weight:700;
}

.stats{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
gap:14px;
}
.stat{
border-radius:22px;
padding:18px;
min-height:108px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.16), rgba(255,255,255,.08));
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
}
.stat strong{
font-size:30px;
line-height:1;
display:block;
margin-bottom:8px;
}
.stat span{
font-size:13px;
line-height:1.7;
color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);
}

.grid{
margin-top:22px;
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;
gap:22px;
}

.panel{padding:28px}
.title{
font-size:28px;
letter-spacing:-.02em;
margin-bottom:8px;
}
.desc{
color:var(--muted);
font-size:15px;
line-height:1.9;
margin-bottom:18px;
}

.fields{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
gap:14px;
}
.field,.field-full{
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
gap:8px;
}
.field-full{grid-column:1/-1}
label{
font-size:14px;
font-weight:800;
color:#284737;
}

input,select{
width:100%;
border:1px solid var(--line);
border-radius:18px;
padding:15px 16px;
background:#fff;
color:var(--text);
font-size:15px;
outline:none;
transition:var(--tr);
box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9);
}
input:focus,select:focus{
border-color:rgba(32,168,100,.45);
box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(61,211,132,.12), 0 10px 24px rgba(32,168,100,.08);
transform:translateY(-1px);
}

.note{
margin-top:16px;
border-radius:22px;
padding:18px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f9fdfa,#eff9f2);
border:1px solid #deeee5;
color:#355b47;
font-size:14px;
line-height:1.9;
}
.note h4{
margin-bottom:10px;
color:var(--green-850);
font-size:15px;
}
.note ul{margin:0;padding-right:18px}
.note li{margin-bottom:4px}

.consent{
margin-top:16px;
border:1px solid var(--line);
border-radius:20px;
padding:16px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.8);
display:flex;
gap:12px;
align-items:flex-start;
color:#496554;
line-height:1.9;
font-size:14px;
}
.consent input{margin-top:5px;width:18px;height:18px}

.btn{
appearance:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;
border-radius:18px;
padding:14px 18px;
font-size:14px;
font-weight:800;
letter-spacing:.2px;
transition:var(--tr);
display:inline-flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
gap:8px;
text-decoration:none;
}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none}
.btn-primary{
width:100%;
margin-top:16px;
color:#fff;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--green-900),var(--green-700));
box-shadow:0 16px 28px rgba(27,141,88,.22);
}
.btn-secondary{
color:var(--green-900);
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8faf8,#edf4ef);
border:1px solid #dbe9e0;
}
.btn-outline{
color:var(--green-900);
background:#fff;
border:1px solid var(--line);
}

.feature-list{display:grid;gap:14px}
.feature{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:52px 1fr;
gap:14px;
align-items:start;
padding:16px;
border-radius:20px;
border:1px solid rgba(20,60,40,.08);
background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.96), rgba(248,251,249,.94));
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
}
.feature-icon{
width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;
display:grid;place-items:center;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#effbf3,#e5f7eb);
color:var(--green-850);
font-size:22px;
}
.feature h4{margin-bottom:6px;font-size:16px}
.feature p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}

.hidden{display:none !important}

.assessment{
margin-top:22px;
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 330px;
gap:22px;
align-items:start;
}

.question-card,.sidebar,.result-card{padding:28px}
.question-top{
display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;
}
.mini{
display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
border-radius:999px;padding:8px 12px;
font-size:12px;font-weight:800;
background:#edf9f1;color:var(--green-850);border:1px solid #d6ebde;
}
.qid{
border-radius:999px;
padding:8px 11px;
font-size:12px;font-weight:800;
color:var(--muted);
background:#f5f7f6;border:1px solid #e7efea;
}
.qtext{
font-size:clamp(24px,3.2vw,34px);
line-height:1.55;
letter-spacing:-.02em;
margin-bottom:24px;
min-height:124px;
}
.options{display:grid;gap:12px}
.opt{
width:100%;
text-align:right;
border:1px solid var(--line);
border-radius:20px;
padding:15px 16px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fcfdfc);
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
gap:12px;
cursor:pointer;
transition:var(--tr);
box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(16,39,29,.03);
font-size:15px;
}
.opt:hover{
transform:translateY(-1px);
box-shadow:0 12px 22px rgba(16,39,29,.06);
background:#fafdfb;
}
.opt.active{
border-color:rgba(32,168,100,.42);
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7fdf9,#edf9f1);
box-shadow:0 14px 24px rgba(32,168,100,.09);
}
.opt-score{
min-width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;
display:grid;place-items:center;
font-weight:800;
background:#eef2ef;color:var(--muted);
}
.opt.active .opt-score{
color:#fff;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--green-700),var(--green-600));
}

.qfooter{
margin-top:24px;
display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.qfooter small{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}

.sidebar{position:sticky;top:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg)}
.sidebar h3{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.sidebar p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}
.track{
width:100%;height:12px;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;
background:#e9f1ec;margin:12px 0 10px;
box-shadow:inset 0 1px 1px rgba(16,39,29,.04);
}
.fill{
width:0;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green-850),var(--green-500));
box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(27,141,88,.20);
transition:width .32s ease;
}
.pct{
text-align:center;font-size:32px;font-weight:900;color:var(--green-850);
margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:-.03em;
}
.toggle{
display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;
padding:12px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);
margin-bottom:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fafcfb);
font-size:14px;
}
.nav-grid{
display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px;
max-height:380px;overflow:auto;
}
.nav-btn{
height:42px;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;
border:1px solid var(--line);
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfcfb);
color:var(--muted);font-weight:800;
transition:var(--tr);
}
.nav-btn:hover{background:#f8fbf9}
.nav-btn.answered{background:#edf9f1;color:var(--green-850);border-color:#d4eadc}
.nav-btn.current{
color:#fff;border-color:var(--green-700);
background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--green-700),var(--green-600));
box-shadow:0 8px 16px rgba(27,141,88,.18);
}

.result-grid{
margin-top:22px;
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;
gap:22px;
}
.stack{display:grid;gap:22px}
.result-card{box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg)}
.section-head{
display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px;
}
.stage-chip{
border-radius:999px;padding:8px 12px;
background:#eef7f2;border:1px solid #d9ebe0;
color:var(--green-850);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;
}

.profile-codes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:18px 0}
.profile-chip{
display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
padding:12px 14px;border-radius:20px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fcf9,#f1f8f4);
border:1px solid #dceee4;
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
}
.profile-chip strong{display:block;font-size:18px}
.profile-chip span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

.subgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}
.subbox{
border:1px solid #e4eee8;border-radius:20px;padding:16px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdfc);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
}
.subbox h4{margin-bottom:8px;font-size:18px}
.subbox p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}

.badge{
display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
border-radius:999px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;border:1px solid transparent;
}
.b-ex2{background:#eaf8ef;color:#157347;border-color:#cdebd8}
.b-ex{background:#eef9ef;color:#23804e;border-color:#d5eddc}
.b-vg{background:#eef5fd;color:#295f9f;border-color:#d7e6f8}
.b-good{background:#fff5e9;color:#a56810;border-color:#f4e1bd}
.b-acc{background:#f3f4f6;color:#55606b;border-color:#e3e6eb}

.major-list{display:grid;gap:16px}
.major{
position:relative;overflow:hidden;
border:1px solid #dfeae4;border-radius:26px;padding:20px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdfc);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
transition:var(--tr);
}
.major::before{
content:"";position:absolute;top:0;inset-inline-start:0;width:6px;height:100%;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--green-700),var(--green-500));
}
.major:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 22px 34px rgba(15,61,46,.08)}
.major-head{
display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;margin-bottom:12px;
}
.major-head h4{font-size:21px;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.major-head p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}

.chip-grid{
display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:12px;
}
.chip{
border-radius:18px;padding:12px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f9fbfa,#f3f7f5);
border:1px solid #e7efea;
}
.chip strong{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:13px;color:var(--green-850)}
.chip span{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}

.branch{
margin-top:14px;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 16px;
display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;
border:1px solid #dce9e2;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbf9,#f2f8f4);
}
.branch.good{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eef9f1,#e5f5ea);border-color:#cfe9d6}
.branch.warn{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff8ef,#fff2df);border-color:#f0ddbb}
.branch strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:14px;color:var(--green-900)}
.branch span{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#52655a}
.branch-state{
min-width:132px;text-align:center;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;
border:1px solid transparent;
}
.branch-state.good{background:#e7f7ec;color:#1b7a49;border-color:#cce8d4}
.branch-state.warn{background:#fff3df;color:#9b640f;border-color:#efd7aa}

.examples{margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.examples span{
background:#f1f6f3;border:1px solid #e1ebe6;border-radius:999px;
padding:8px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#466150;
}

.analysis-list{display:grid;gap:12px}
.analysis{
border:1px solid #e4eee8;border-radius:18px;padding:14px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdfc);
box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
}
.analysis-top{
display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.bar{
height:8px;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;background:#e9f1ec;
}
.bar span{
display:block;height:100%;width:0;border-radius:inherit;
background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green-850),var(--green-500));
box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(32,168,100,.16);
transition:width .62s ease;
}

.alert{
border-radius:20px;padding:16px;line-height:1.9;font-size:14px;
border:1px solid #ddeae2;background:#f8fbf9;box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);
}
.alert.good{background:#eef9f1;border-color:#d5ecd9}
.alert.warn{background:#fff8ef;border-color:#f2e4cb}

.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.95}

.fade-in{
opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);animation:fadeUp .5s ease forwards;
}
@keyframes fadeUp{to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.slide{animation:slideCard .35s ease}
@keyframes slideCard{
from{opacity:.25;transform:translateY(10px) scale(.995)}
to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1)}
}
.shake{animation:shake .32s linear}
@keyframes shake{
0%,100%{transform:translateX(0)}
20%{transform:translateX(4px)}
40%{transform:translateX(-4px)}
60%{transform:translateX(3px)}
80%{transform:translateX(-3px)}
}

@media (max-width:1080px){
.hero-grid,.grid,.assessment,.result-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.sidebar{position:static}
.hero h1{max-width:none}
}
@media (max-width:720px){
.wrap{width:min(100% - 16px,100%)}
.hero,.panel,.question-card,.sidebar,.result-card{padding:18px}
.fields,.subgrid,.chip-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
.qtext{min-height:auto;font-size:24px}
.major-head,.question-top,.qfooter{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
.hero{padding:24px}
.title{font-size:24px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<section id="screen-start" class="fade-in">
<div class="card hero">
<div class="hero-grid">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">🎓 نظام التوجيه المهني المدمج | ثانوية الجنان</div>
<h1>اختبار الميول المهنية والشخصية</h1>
<p>مبني على الدمج بين RIASEC والسمات الشخصية وأسلوب العمل، مع نتائج تحليلية واضحة وتوصيات مرتبطة بسوق العمل الحديث بدل الاكتفاء بنسب مضللة.</p>
<div class="hero-pills">
<span class="pill">150 سؤالاً</span>
<span class="pill">نموذج مدمج</span>
<span class="pill">Top 4 عند التقارب</span>
<span class="pill">تحليل وصفي</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="stats">
<div class="stat"><strong>90</strong><span>أسئلة الميول المهنية RIASEC</span></div>
<div class="stat"><strong>30</strong><span>أسئلة السمات الشخصية</span></div>
<div class="stat"><strong>30</strong><span>أسئلة أسلوب العمل</span></div>
<div class="stat"><strong>Top 4</strong><span>يُعتمد الحرف الرابع عند تقارب النتيجة</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="grid">
<div class="card panel fade-in" style="animation-delay:.08s">
<h2 class="title">بيانات الطالب</h2>
<p class="desc">أدخل المعلومات الأساسية ثم ابدأ الاختبار. يفضّل الإجابة بهدوء وصدق للحصول على ملف مهني أكثر دقة.</p>

<div class="fields">
<div class="field">
<label for="studentName">الاسم الكامل</label>
<input id="studentName" type="text" placeholder="اكتب اسم الطالب" />
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="studentGrade">الصف</label>
<select id="studentGrade">
<option value="">اختر الصف</option>
<option value="أول ثانوي">أول ثانوي</option>
<option value="ثاني ثانوي">ثاني ثانوي</option>
<option value="ثالث ثانوي">ثالث ثانوي</option>
</select>
</div>

<div class="field-full">
<label for="studentSection">الفرع / القسم</label>
<select id="studentSection">
<option value="">اختر الفرع / القسم</option>
<option value="غير محدد بعد">غير محدد بعد</option>
<option value="علوم حياة">علوم حياة</option>
<option value="علوم عامة (رياضيات)">علوم عامة (رياضيات)</option>
<option value="اقتصاد واجتماع">اقتصاد واجتماع</option>
</select>
</div>
</div>

<div class="note">
<h4>إرشادات مهمة قبل البدء</h4>
<ul>
<li>أجب بحسب ما يشبهك عادةً، لا بحسب الصورة المثالية التي تتمنى إظهارها.</li>
